  "flow_summary": "The interviewer performed well on structured questionnaires but struggled significantly with conversational flow and handling 'I don't know' responses. The system repeatedly looped on medication history questions despite the patient's clear inability to provide information, and it failed to effectively manage the patient's safety disclosure, resulting in a repetitive and somewhat mechanical interaction.",
