      "severity": "moderate",
      "category": "flow",
      "evidence": "The interviewer repeatedly used the phrase 'پیش از آنکه ادامه دهیم، می‌توانید به سؤال بالا پاسخ دهید؟' even when the patient had already provided a clear answer, making the conversation feel robotic."
