      "evidence": "Upon the patient disclosing active suicidal intent, the interviewer's response was somewhat disjointed, and the subsequent follow-up question ('این افکار و برنامه از چه زمانی شروع شده‌اند؟') felt poorly timed given the immediate crisis."
